            <h4 class="font-semibold mb-1"><i class="fas fa-graduation-cap mr-2"></i>Level Up Your Skills</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-white/80 mb-3">Explore our cybersecurity diploma & certification courses.</p>
            <a href="/courses" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 w-full px-4 py-2 bg-white text-indigo-700 text-sm font-semibold rounded-xl hover:bg-white/90 transition-colors">
              Explore Courses <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-xs"></i>
